-  Excellent experience with controllers\n\nIn addition to traditional draughts experience, we will provide rich VR features, including: Online mode, better interactive experience, various scenes for Checkers, real-time voice chat, Checkers with friends, AI hosts with different characters.\n\nDownload it now", "short_description": "Welcome to Westworld!\n\nWhat say you to a \"civilised duel\" where you are the guest? Imagine yourself in a pleated shirt and a notched collar-styled waistcoat covered by a suit made of brushed fabric, a fedora sitting on your head. You may walk into a tavern and order an old pot, playing draughts with your old friend in the free and wild west. \nFeatures\n- Multiple AI difficulty levels available\n- Dueling cowboys in the Wild West\n-  Detailed instructions\n-  Undo function\n\nDownload it now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://checkersvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SUPLIFE PTE", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://checkersvr.com/home", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["STRATEGY", "PUZZLE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "468757508092274"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 23, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1670215410775176"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1257415419906885"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "162704596183907